1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,940
Maybe you're grieving, maybe you're hurting, maybe your mind won't let you rest

2
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:06,860
Maybe getting out of bed today feels like an impossible test

3
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:10,300
Then sit up if you can, and put your feet down where they go

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:14,220
And if all you've got's a whisper, then a whispered yes is enough, you know

5
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:17,420
You don't have to feel it yet, you don't have to mean it all the way

6
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:21,000
Some days you say it till you mean it, and that's how you start the day
